{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t剛上任的藥物及醫療器械監督管理總監李自力表示，將成立以臨床評審為核心的跨專業科學團隊，建立具全面能力、國際信任和獨立戰略定位的藥監機構，服務香港以至全世界的患者。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n衞生署署長林文健指出，相信李自力豐富的國際經驗和領導才能，能夠帶領香港革新醫藥審批制度。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:17.615207+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:03:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:58:18.660542+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:17.936206+00:00","content_hash":"81f0a0df79e95e66fb58256434462dfcac77a6ca5149df26fc2662c10821eeb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}